    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32744" root="غيظ" body-key="g">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتاظ</span></b>  <i>He was</i> or <i>became, affected with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيْظ</span>
[or <i>anger;</i> or <i>rage;</i> &amp;c.; i. e. <i>he was,</i> or <i>became, angered;</i> or <i>enraged;</i> &amp;c.]; (S, Msb, K;)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ كَذَا</span> <i>by reason of such a thing;</i> and sometimes
one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ لَا شَىْءٍ</span> <i>by reason of nothing;</i> (Msb;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغيّظ</span></b> . (S, K.)

